OL,3,ATwelve killed in attack on airport in
OL,4,ASaudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Houthis said they were behind
OL,7,Fstrikes on the airport on Thursday that
OL,8,Fkilled three people and damaged a
OL,9,Fplane, but did not immediately take
OL,10,Fresponsibility for the attacks on
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
