OL,3,AYoung men live in fear of being
OL,4,Asnatched off the streets and sold to
OL,5,AMyanmar's army
OL,6,
OL,7,FYou do not stay out after dark if
OL,8,Fyou're young and able-bodied in Hpa-An,
OL,9,Fthe capital of Myanmar's southern Karen
OL,10,Fstate. In recent months this has become
OL,11,Fconventional wisdom.
OL,13,FBut Zaw Min has no choice.
OL,15,F"I worry, but I have to go out to
OL,16,Fwork," says the 26-year-old tuk tuk
OL,17,Fdriver, who asked that his real name be
OL,18,Fomitted out of fear for his safety. "My
OL,19,Ffamily call me all the time and remind
OL,20,Fme not to drive passengers too far; to
OL,21,Fbe careful who I take as a passenger...
OL,22,FI have to be vigilant all the time.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
