OL,3,ARussian glide bomb attack on
OL,4,AZaporizhzhia kills at least 20 people
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia has attacked the Ukrainian city
OL,7,Fof Zaporizhzhia with five glide bombs,
OL,8,Fkilling at least 20 people including
OL,9,Ffour children, local officials said.
OL,11,FThe glide bombs hit residential
OL,12,Fbuildings in the southern city on
OL,13,FSaturday morning. At least 32 others
OL,14,Fwere injured in the attack, with more
OL,15,Fstill missing and believed to be under
OL,16,Fthe rubble.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
